    <string name="tv_sync_body">Easy way: press \"Show code on TV\", then on your phone open Play → Settings → \"Wi-Fi sync\" card, type the TV\'s code into the \"Other device\'s code\" box and press Connect. Or enter the phone\'s code below. Add-on repositories, watch history and favorites are synced between the two devices; after the first sync the devices stay paired and sync without a code.</string>
